<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Lorry Receipt - {{lr_number}}</title>
    <style>
        @page {
            size: A6 landscape;
            margin: 2mm;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html,
        body {
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #000;
            background: #fff;
        }

        @media print {
            body {
                -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
                print-color-adjust: exact;
            }
        }

        .sheet {
            width: 100%;
            border: 1.4px solid #000;
            padding: 2.4mm;
            position: relative;
        }

        .top-strip {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
            align-items: center;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1.4mm;
        }

        .top-strip .subject {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .brand-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
            align-items: end;
            column-gap: 1.8mm;
            margin-bottom: 0.8mm;
        }

        .brand-row .logo {
            font-size: 21px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 0.4px;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .brand-row .name {
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
            line-height: 1;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .address-row,
        .tax-row {
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5mm;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .meta-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 2mm;
            margin-top: 0.4mm;
            margin-bottom: 0.4mm;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .meta-row .value {
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1;
            margin-left: 1.2mm;
        }

        .meta-right {
            text-align: right;
        }

        .line-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 2mm;
            margin-bottom: 0.4mm;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            align-items: end;
        }

        .line-field {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
            column-gap: 1mm;
            align-items: end;
        }

        .line-field .line {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            min-height: 4.8mm;
            line-height: 4.3mm;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 500;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 0 1mm;
            overflow: hidden;
            white-space: nowrap;
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
        }

        .from-to-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 2mm;
            margin-bottom: 0.6mm;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .from-to-row .left {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto 1fr;
            column-gap: 1mm;
            align-items: end;
        }

        .from-to-row .right {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
            column-gap: 1mm;
            align-items: end;
        }

        .from-to-row .line {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            min-height: 4.8mm;
            line-height: 4.3mm;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 500;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 0 1mm;
            overflow: hidden;
            white-space: nowrap;
            text-overflow: ellipsis;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        .goods-table {
            table-layout: fixed;
            margin-top: 0.4mm;
        }

        .goods-table th,
        .goods-table td {
            border: 1px solid #000;
            vertical-align: top;
            padding: 0.5mm;
        }

        .goods-table th {
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 1.05;
        }

        .goods-body {
            height: 30mm;
        }

        .stack {
            font-size: 17px;
            line-height: 1.1;
            font-weight: 700;
            word-break: break-word;
        }

        .stack div {
            margin-bottom: 0.6mm;
        }

        .desc {
            font-size: 10px;
            line-height: 1.15;
            font-weight: 500;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            word-break: break-word;
        }

        .center {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .right {
            text-align: right;
        }

        .bottom {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 58% 42%;
            margin-top: 0;
            border-left: 1px solid #000;
            border-right: 1px solid #000;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
        }

        .left-block {
            border-right: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 1mm;
        }

        .value-line {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
            align-items: end;
            gap: 1mm;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.6mm;
        }

        .value-line .value {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            min-height: 3.8mm;
            line-height: 3.4mm;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 0 0.8mm;
        }

        .copy-label {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 0.6mm;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .risk-line {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.8mm;
            line-height: 1.1;
        }

        .vehicle-loading {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 42% 58%;
            border: 1px solid #000;
            margin-bottom: 0.8mm;
        }

        .vehicle-box {
            border-right: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 0.8mm;
        }

        .vehicle-box .label {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 0.6mm;
        }

        .vehicle-box .value {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.1;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            word-break: break-word;
            min-height: 10mm;
        }

        .loading-box .title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 800;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 0.4mm;
        }

        .loading-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
        }

        .loading-grid .cell {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            min-height: 4.2mm;
            line-height: 3.8mm;
            padding: 0 0.6mm;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .loading-grid .cell:nth-last-child(-n+2) {
            border-bottom: 0;
        }

        .decl {
            font-size: 9px;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 1.2;
            margin-bottom: 0.6mm;
        }

        .liability {
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 1.5mm;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .sign-row {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            align-items: end;
            gap: 0.6mm;
        }

        .sign-row .line {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            height: 4mm;
        }

        .sign-row .label {
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .right-block {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-rows: auto auto 1fr;
        }

        .seal-box {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 0.8mm;
        }

        .seal-box .label {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 0.6mm;
        }

        .seal-box .value {
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            min-height: 6mm;
        }

        .charges {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            table-layout: fixed;
        }

        .charges td {
            border-bottom: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 0.8mm;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .charges td:last-child {
            width: 34%;
            border-left: 1px solid #000;
            text-align: right;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: none;
        }

        .charges tr:last-child td {
            border-bottom: 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 900;
        }

        .company-sign {
            border-top: 1px solid #000;
            display: grid;
            align-items: end;
            padding: 1mm;
            font-size: 10px;
            font-weight: 800;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            text-align: right;
            min-height: 12mm;
        }

        .watermark {
            position: absolute;
            left: 24mm;
            top: 47mm;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.11);
            transform: rotate(-25deg);
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            pointer-events: none;
            user-select: none;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        .generated {
            margin-top: 0.8mm;
            font-size: 8px;
            color: #555;
            text-align: right;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="sheet">
        <div class="top-strip">
            <div class="subject">Subject to Chennai Jurisdiction only</div>
            <div>Phone: 044 - 4272 5261</div>
        </div>

        <div class="brand-row">
            <div class="logo">CTC</div>
            <div class="name">Chandra Transport Corporation</div>
        </div>

        <div class="address-row">
            Regd. O.: Flat No. 31, 3rd Floor, BBC Villa Complex, 65, Prakasam Salai, Broadway, Chennai - 600108
        </div>
        <div class="tax-row">
            E-mail: chennal@chandratransport.in | Website: www.chandratransport.in | GSTIN: 33AACPG4250G1ZA
        </div>

        <div class="meta-row">
            <div>Lorry Receipt No. <span class="value">{{lr_number}}</span></div>
            <div class="meta-right">Date <span class="value">{{date}}</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="line-row">
            <div class="line-field">
                <span>Consignor</span>
                <span class="line">{{consignor_name}}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="line-field">
                <span>Consignee</span>
                <span class="line">{{consignee_name}}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="from-to-row">
            <div class="left">
                <span>From</span>
                <span class="line">{{origin}}</span>
                <span>To</span>
                <span class="line">{{destination}}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="right">
                <span>Delivery at</span>
                <span class="line">{{delivery_at}}</span>
            </div>
        </div>

        <table class="goods-table">
            <colgroup>
                <col style="width: 9%;">
                <col style="width: 42%;">
                <col style="width: 5%;">
                <col style="width: 5%;">
                <col style="width: 8%;">
                <col style="width: 7%;">
                <col style="width: 4%;">
                <col style="width: 20%;">
            </colgroup>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th>No. of Articles</th>
                    <th>Description of Goods<br>(Said to Contain)</th>
                    <th colspan="2">Weight<br>QTL &nbsp; KG.</th>
                    <th>Rate<br>Per QTL</th>
                    <th colspan="2">Freight<br>Rs. &nbsp; P.</th>
                    <th>Remarks</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                <tr class="goods-body">
                    <td class="stack center">
                        {{#each goods_items}}
                        <div>{{this.articles_count}}</div>
                        {{/each}}
                    </td>
                    <td class="desc">
                        {{#each goods_items}}
                        <div>{{this.description}}</div>
                        {{/each}}
                    </td>
                    <td class="stack center">
                        {{#each goods_items}}
                        <div>{{this.weight_qtl}}</div>
                        {{/each}}
                    </td>
                    <td class="stack center">
                        {{#each goods_items}}
                        <div>{{this.weight_kg}}</div>
                        {{/each}}
                    </td>
                    <td class="stack right">
                        {{#each goods_items}}
                        <div>{{this.rate_per_qtl}}</div>
                        {{/each}}
                    </td>
                    <td class="stack right">
                        {{#each goods_items}}
                        <div>{{this.freight_rs}}</div>
                        {{/each}}
                    </td>
                    <td class="stack right">
                        {{#each goods_items}}
                        <div>{{this.freight_p}}</div>
                        {{/each}}
                    </td>
                    <td class="stack">
                        {{#each goods_items}}
                        <div>{{this.remarks}}</div>
                        {{/each}}
                        {{#if remarks}}
                        <div>{{remarks}}</div>
                        {{/if}}
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </tbody>
        </table>

        <div class="bottom">
            <div class="left-block">
                <div class="value-line">
                    <span>Value Rs.</span>
                    <span class="value">{{value_rs}}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="copy-label">Carrier Copy</div>
                <div class="risk-line">Booked on Owner's Risk {{#if booked_on_owners_risk}}YES{{else}}NO{{/if}}</div>

                <div class="vehicle-loading">
                    <div class="vehicle-box">
                        <div class="label">Vehicle No.</div>
                        <div class="value">{{vehicle_number}}</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="loading-box">
                        <div class="title">At Loading Point</div>
                        <div class="loading-grid">
                            <div class="cell">In Date</div>
                            <div class="cell">{{loading_point_times.in_date}}</div>
                            <div class="cell">In Time</div>
                            <div class="cell">{{loading_point_times.in_time}}</div>
                            <div class="cell">Out Date</div>
                            <div class="cell">{{loading_point_times.out_date}}</div>
                            <div class="cell">Out Time</div>
                            <div class="cell">{{loading_point_times.out_time}}</div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="decl">
                    I / We declare that the goods tendered by me / us do not contain any contraband goods and description of goods tendered by me / us has been correctly entered.
                    I / We have read and understood the terms and condition printed on the reverse and I / We shall abide by the same.
                </div>
                <div class="liability">Not responsible for leakage &amp; breakage</div>

                <div class="sign-row">
                    <div class="line"></div>
                    <div class="label">Signature of the Consignor</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="right-block">
                <div class="seal-box">
                    <div class="label">Seal No.</div>
                    <div class="value">{{seal_number}}</div>
                </div>

                <table class="charges">
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Surcharge</td>
                            <td>{{surcharge}}</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Hamali Charges</td>
                            <td>{{hamali_charges}}</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>St. Charges</td>
                            <td>{{st_charges}}</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td>Total</td>
                            <td>{{total}}</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>

                <div class="company-sign">For Chandra Transport Corporation</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="watermark">CTC</div>
        <div class="generated">Generated on {{generated_at}}</div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
